From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Domenico D'Arrigo <DCHEM88@hotmail.it>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:29:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] LvglDisplayEngineDxe: Show the ouroBIOS logo and name in the
 menu bar

The menu bar opened with a settings symbol. Put the firmware's logo
there instead, an ouroboros drawn as a printed circuit, 16x16 pixel art
(LvglLogo.h, generated from the SVG of the project by tools/logo.py: ring
in the accent color, infinity in the secondary text color), as an LVGL
image, enlarged by a whole factor only and without anti-aliasing so that
its pixels stay square at any UI scale; then PcdLvglAptioHeaderVendor,
the firmware name, in the text color, before the setup title and the
device model.

Co-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018n3yuWwDLW63F4vdf7ZFTv
---
 Include/LvglTheme.h                           |  8 +--
 LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglAptioChrome.c        | 33 ++++++++----
 LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglDisplayEngineDxe.inf |  1 +
 LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglLogo.h               | 51 +++++++++++++++++++
 LvglPkg.dec                                   |  2 +-
 5 files changed, 81 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 LvglDisplayEngineDxe/LvglLogo.h

diff --git a/Include/LvglTheme.h b/Include/LvglTheme.h
index d13bfc6..e92493a 100644
--- a/Include/LvglTheme.h
+++ b/Include/LvglTheme.h
@@ -117,8 +117,8 @@
 #define THEME_WALLPAPER_ORBS          3
 
 //
-// Menu bar across the top of the screen: badge, title and model on the
-// left; Secure Boot, battery, date and time on the right. Translucent, the
+// Menu bar across the top of the screen: logo, firmware name, title and
+// model on the left; Secure Boot, battery, date and time on the right. Translucent, the
 // wallpaper blurred behind it.
 //
 #define THEME_MENUBAR_HEIGHT          LvglThemePx(26)
@@ -129,7 +129,7 @@
 #define THEME_MENUBAR_BORDER_OPA      LV_OPA_10
 #define THEME_COLOR_HEADER_TEXT       0xFFFFFF
 #define THEME_COLOR_HEADER_DIM        THEME_COLOR_TEXT_SECONDARY
-#define THEME_HEADER_BADGE_SYMBOL     LV_SYMBOL_SETTINGS
+#define THEME_HEADER_LOGO_SIZE        LvglThemePx(16)
 #define THEME_PAD_HEADER_X            LvglThemePx(14)
 #define THEME_PAD_HEADER_GAP          LvglThemePx(16)
 
@@ -332,7 +332,7 @@
 //
 // Chrome strings and layout overrides (platform DSC / PCD):
 //   PcdLvglAptioHeaderTitle      -- title in the menu bar
-//   PcdLvglAptioHeaderVendor     -- extra text in the menu bar (optional)
+//   PcdLvglAptioHeaderVendor     -- the firmware name next to the logo (optional)
